File: src/fit_field.cpp
Function: Field::GetType
One decode of the test corpus takes about 359.528 ms.
The code below currently runs at 0.873172 of the original SDK's decode time; the best found so far is 0.873172.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if ( type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID )
        return type;

    if ((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields))
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    return profile->fields[profileIndex].type;
}
